@startuml components
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title M-DP1: dispatcher v0 command / v1 daemon (draft; not implemented)
actor "Caller process\n(person, orchestrator or optional board adapter)\ncaller UID; principal + registered key" as C
rectangle "Service UID: swarma-dispatcher" {
  component "v0 no-argument sudo command\none request per invocation" as CMD
  component "v1 daemon\npeer-authenticated socket" as DMN
  component "Shared core\nauthority, admission, effects, reconciliation" as CORE
  component "Execution supervisor\nv0 detached; v1 in daemon\nservice UID" as SUP
  component "v0 internal sweep\nservice-only timer, every minute\nv1 daemon sweeps internally" as SW
  database "Dispatcher-owned persistent state\ninput/1, agent/1, run/1, keys, claims,\neffect table, journal, index, bounded logs" as DS
}
component "swarma-user-manager\nprivileged helper (root)\nowns account ledger / termination evidence" as H
component "swarma-user-launcher\nroot until GID/UID drop\nwrites start receipt" as L
component "swarma-credential-broker\nunprivileged broker service\nowns bindings, grants/revocations, leases, secrets" as B
component "curator-run narrow exec mode\nagent UID; first broker consumer\nthen exec harness under same account" as E
component "swarma-session-host service\nSH2+ gated; own service UID\nowns session metadata, logs, receipts, fences" as SH
component "swarma-session-runner\nSH2+ gated; agent UID\nowns PTY/app-server and lease renewal" as SR
component "Key keeper\nlater gated integration\nowns registered identity / revocation state" as K
C --> CMD : signed dispatch-op/1 (v0)
C --> DMN : signed requests on dispatch/1 (v1)
CMD --> CORE
DMN --> CORE
SW --> CORE
CORE --> DS : lock; journal before effects\natomic records; replay on startup
CORE --> H : user.create / user.retire / exec.stop\ndistinct durable effect IDs; own generations
CORE --> B : bind / unbind; attenuated leaf\nrequest intersect caller intersect dispatcher\ncaller chain retained as dependency
CORE --> SUP : execution claim; durable registration
SUP --> L : launch.start; distinct E-launch
L --> E : receipt while root; reset; drop GID/UID\nimmutable plan FD3; no broker FD
E --> B : own connection; lease\ncaller dependency rechecked
CORE ..> SH : later backend; ticket + fenced operation IDs
SH ..> L : host-role launch with valid unused ticket
SH ..> SR : session input admission / metadata
SR ..> B : later qualified consumer; own connection
CORE ..> K : one-shot registration / separate revocation\nonly after confirmed retirement
note bottom of CORE
  Refusal: principal/key/signature/chain/quota failures never queue.
  Capacity: v0 refuses; v1 queues and rechecks at dequeue.
  Unknown/contradictory observations keep records pending:
  never relaunch, release capacity or declare cleanup successful.
  Provision failure: unbind if bound, retire if created; confirm cleanup.
  Root caller request ID is correlation, not a shared receiver key.
end note
note right of SH
  SH2+ disabled until ticket grammar, host role and ownership handoff
  are published. Stop stays dispatcher -> helper exec.stop.
  SH1 behavior is unspecified in spec §12.
  Log handoff is unspecified in spec §16 (open question 5).
end note
note right of E
  §5.3 intake / Decision 0021 amendment and credential qualification
  gate activation. Caller composes; executor verifies/executes only.
  Executor CLI/plan schema are unspecified in spec §5.3.
end note
note right of K
  Standing identity revocation is operator-only with a signed record.
  Keeper API/process UID is unspecified in spec §14.
  Broker service UID spelling is unspecified in spec §3.1.
end note
legend
  Defining spec: [[https://github.com/relux-works/swarma-dispatcher/blob/main/spec/dispatcher.md#2-versions §2 versions]]
  [[https://github.com/relux-works/swarma-dispatcher/blob/main/spec/dispatcher.md#3-identities-and-authority §3 authority]]
  [[https://github.com/relux-works/swarma-dispatcher/blob/main/spec/dispatcher.md#4-records-and-state §4 state]]
  [[https://github.com/relux-works/swarma-dispatcher/blob/main/spec/dispatcher.md#12-session-host-backend-later-activation-gate §12 SH2+]] / §14 gates
endlegend
@enduml
